// use prisma-8
// =============================================================================
// RS Staffing — Phase 1 data contract (Prisma ORM 8, PostgreSQL)
//
// Conventions (see "RS Staffing — ER plan" doc):
//   ids    uuid v7, generated by the ORM (@default(uuid(7)))
//   money  BigInt paise, columns end in _paise. No floats anywhere.
//   rates  Numeric(7,4) percent
//   dated  effective_from / effective_to (no-overlap exclusion constraints
//          live in sql/001_extras.sql — Prisma 8 has no exclusion constraint)
//   enums  text + generated CHECK (Prisma 8 enums are value sets, not pg enums)
//   time   Date / Timestamptz read and write Temporal values. On Node < 26.8.2
//          import 'temporal-polyfill/full/global' before the first query.
//   spaces app (everything), vault (Aadhaar only), audit (append-only log)
//   maker-checker: approved_by <> created_by, enforced by @@check
// =============================================================================
